        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "If I enable `cimport_from_pyx` (just manually, in changing Options.py) then I do get the code you show. I wasn't personally able to get it with repeated serial builds of `pip wheel .`\n\nSo I think it probably is _something_ along those lines. Although I don't know why disabling parallel builds didn't prevent it.",
